iamf-sentinel
Copyright 2026 The iamf-sentinel authors

This product includes software developed as an original, clean-room
implementation written from the AOM IAMF v1.1.0 specification and
ISO/IEC 14496-12 (ADR-3). No AOM reference-decoder or reference-encoder
source code is used or derived. Reference decoders are invoked only as
subprocess oracles, and only by the separate iamf-sentinel-pro plugin
(not part of this package).

"IAMF" is used descriptively. "Eclipsa" is a trademark of its owner and
is not used in this project's naming.
